{
  "id": "MRK.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "MRK",
  "reference": "Mar 5",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naakiza omusaija akwasirwe omwoyo omubi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baahika nseeri y'enyanja, omunsi y'Abageraseene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu obu yarugire omu bwato, yatangaana omusaija akwasirwe omwoyo mubi, ow'akaba naaruga omu bituuro ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nambere yaikaraga. Busaho n'omu ow'akaba naasobora kumuboha noobwakubaire kumubohesa orujegere; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "habwokuba emirundi nyingi baamubohesaaga empingo n'enjegere, baitu enjegere yaicwaaga, kandi n'empingo azicwacwana; hataroho ow'akaba aina amaani ag'okumuculeeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekiro na nyamusana yaikaraga naayamuliza omu bituuro na ha nsozi, naayehutaaza n'amabaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu yalengiire Yesu, yairuka, yamuteereza amaju; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yayamuza n'iraka likooto ati: “Yesu, Omwana wa Ruhanga anyakuli haiguru muno, noontura ki? Ninkurahira omu ibara lya Ruhanga, otancanza.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba Yesu akaba agugambiire ati: “Murugeho, iwe omwoyo omubi!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu nukwo kugukaguza ati: “Ibara Iyawe niryo liha?” Gwagarukamu guti: “Ibara lyange ninyowe Ihe; habwokuba tuli baingi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwamwesengereza muno aleke kugubinga omunsi omu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haihi aho ha mbanda y'orusozi hakaba haroho igana lingi ly'empunu nizirya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "emyoyo emibi yamwesengereza eti: “Tusindike omu mpunu ezi, nizo tutaahemu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagiikiriza. Emyoyo emibi yaruga omu muntu ogu, yataaha omu mpunu; kandi igana ly'empunu ezirukuhika nk'enkumi ibiri, zaajumbutuka, zaakonkomoka enengo, zaagwa omu nyanja, zaafeeramu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaliisa bairuka baakisubirra ab'omu rubuga n'ab'omu byaro. Abantu baija kurora ekibaireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baahika hali Yesu, baasanga omuntu ogu ow'akaba akwasirwe omwoyo omubi aikaliire, ajwaire, kandi ateekaine nuwe ogu ow'akaba akwasirwe ihe ery'emyoyo emibi; baayekanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaakirozire baabasoborra ekibaireho omuntu ogu ow'akaba aroho emyoyo emibi, n'ebibaireho empunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi bbo baatandika kwesengereza Yesu aruge omu mitaano yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe obu akaba naataaha omu bwato, omusaija ow'akaba akwasirwe emyoyo emibi yaija, yamwesengereza amwikirize kwikara nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Yesu yayanga, yamugambira ati: “Taaha owaanyu omu bagenzi baawe, obagambire ebikuru MUKAMA ebi akukoliire, kandi n'embabazi ezi akugiriire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yagenda yatandika kurangirra ab'omu kicweka ky'Embuga Ikumi byona Yesu ebi yamukoliire; abantu boona baatangaara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naahumbuura muhara wa Yairo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu obu yayambukiire omu bwato, yagaruka nseeri y'enyanja, kandi ekitebe ky'abantu baingi kyamwesoroolezaaho; yaikara ha musa gw'enyanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho haija omu ha bakuru b'isorrokaniro, ibara lye Yairo. Obu yarozire Yesu, yagwa ha bigere bye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yamwesengereza naagamba ati: “Muhara wange ali haihi kufa. Ija omuteho emikono yaawe, nukwo akire, kandi ayomeere.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yagenda nawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu naakiza omukazi ow'akejwiso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekitebe ky'abantu baingi kyamuhondera kimugoteriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakaba haroho omukazi ayamazire emyaka ikumi n'ebiri arwaire akejwiso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "TOB.2.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Tob 2:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafumu baingi bakaba balengereho kumutambira, kandi akaba amaliizeyo ebye byona, ataraarwe naakake baitu akeeyongera kuba kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaba ahuliire ebi baagambahoga Yesu, yamuruga enyuma naaraba omu kitebe ky'abantu, yamwirra haihi, yakwata ha kijwaro kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akagumya ati: “Noobu ndakwataho kwonka ekijwaro kye ndaakira.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho akejwiso ke kaayoma; kandi yayehurra omu mubiri gwe nkooku akiziibwe endwara ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu obu yamanyire amaani agamurugiremu, ahonaaho yahindukira ekitebe ky'abantu yakaguza ati: “Nooha akwasire ha bijwaro byange?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeegesebwa be baamugarukamu bati: “Noorora ekitebe ky'abantu nkooku kirukukufunza, kandi nookaguza ngu: ‘Nooha ankwasireho?’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu uwe yamagamaga kurora ow'amukwasireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukazi habw'okumanya ekimukozirweho, yaija naatiina kandi naatukumira, yajuumara hansi omu maiso ge, yamugambirra kimu amazima goona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nukwo Yesu kumugambira ati: “Mwisiki wange, okwikiriza kwawe nukwo kukukirize; genda n'obusinge, okirre kimu endwara yaawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu obu akaba naakyabaza, haija abarukuruga mb'omukuru w'isorrokaniro, baamubikira bati: “Muhara waawe afiire. Omwegesa nokyamujwahiza ki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu Yesu eki tiyakitaho mutima, yagambira omukuru w'isorrokaniro ati: “Otatiina, ikiriza kwonka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ataikirize muntu weena kugenda nawe, kwihaho Petero, Yakobbo, na Yohaana owanyina Yakobbo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu baahikire ha nju y'omukuru w'isorrokaniro, Yesu yarora abantu abarukurabanganamu, abamu nibarra kandi nibateera empamo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu yataahiremu yabakaguza ati: “Nimurabanganiramu ki kandi nimulizibwa ki? Omwana tafiire, baitu agwijagiire.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bbo baamusekeereza. Baitu boona yabaturukya aheeru, yatwara ise omwana na nyina, n'abo aba yaizire nabo, yahingura omu kisiika omwana nambere akaba ali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yamukwata ha mukono, yamugambira ati: “Talita kuumi;” amakuru gaakyo ngu: “Kaisiki iwe, ninkugambira nti: Imuka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahonaaho omwisiki yaimuka, yatandika kurubata; akaba ali w'emyaka ikumi n'ebiri y'obukuru. Abantu obu baarozire eki, baahuniira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 5:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yabateererra kutamanyisa muntu weena, kandi yaragira bahe omwisiki ekyokulya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.5.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.5.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
